(Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンクイズパズルランド　ピカチュウにおまかせ！}}''' ''Pokémon Quiz Puzzle Land: Leave It to Pikachu!'') is a [[Pokémon manga]] composed by [[Hiroshi Takase]] and illustrated by [[Makoto Mizobuchi]]. It was serialized in the ''{{OBP|Pokémon Fan|Japan}}'' magazine from the issue 51 (released on November 18, 2016) to the issue 65 (released on October 4, 2019). The manga utilizes quizzes and puzzles as a method of storytelling. It is 160 pages long.

